WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.646
Open a new temporary chat and upload the chapter PDF.

00:00:04.646 --> 00:00:06.396
ChatGPT reads the uploaded chapter · accelerated.

00:00:06.396 --> 00:00:09.896
Write the prompt · fast typing.

00:00:09.896 --> 00:00:10.227
Send the shortcut as the second message.

00:00:10.227 --> 00:00:12.775
ChatGPT processes the prompt and builds the widget · accelerated.

00:00:12.775 --> 00:00:16.521
Inspect the generated widget before using its controls.

00:00:16.529 --> 00:00:21.522
Ask for a hint on the first clue.

00:00:21.522 --> 00:00:25.875
Enter an incorrect first attempt.

00:00:25.875 --> 00:00:29.475
Check the attempt and inspect the feedback.

00:00:29.475 --> 00:00:33.910
Correct the first word to inference.

00:00:33.910 --> 00:00:38.278
Complete the second clue with training.

00:00:38.278 --> 00:00:42.503
Complete the last clue with context.

00:00:42.503 --> 00:00:45.233
Check all three completed answers.

00:00:45.233 --> 00:00:50.961
Inspect the filled grid and its 3/3 result.

00:00:50.961 --> 00:00:58.017
Reset the puzzle and clear the grid.
